===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|stunta|lang=goh}}. Cognate with Dutch {{term|stond||time|lang=nl}}, English {{term|stound||hour, while|lang=en}}, Danish {{term|stund||while|lang=da}}, Norwegian {{term|stund||while|lang=no}}, Swedish {{term|stund||while|lang=se}}. More at {{l|en|stound}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈʃtʊndə/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Stunde.ogg|audio (Germany)|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-Stunde.ogg|audio (Austria)|lang=de}}

